<div class="detail-block"><h4>Problem</h4><p>The Customer Service team had to open and check the Google ratings and reviews of dozens of stores one by one. Tracking current review counts, preparing reports, and comparing changes between stores created a considerable manual workload.</p></div>
<div class="detail-block"><h4>Solution</h4><p>Google Business links are added to the system once. The application updates either the selected store or every store with one click, then records the star rating, review count, and last update time automatically. All results can also be exported as an Excel report.</p></div>
<div class="detail-block wide"><h4>Impact</h4><p>The need to visit each Google Business profile separately was removed. Customer Service can now view current ratings and review counts for dozens of stores from one screen, while report preparation takes only a few minutes. <strong>Google rating and review tracking for 32 different stores became available on one screen with one click.</strong></p></div>
</div>
