<span class="tag" style="--tag:#FF9F43">Data Analysis</span>
<h2>Unified E-Commerce Sales Reporting Tool</h2><p>A desktop application that combines T-Soft CSV order data and marketplace Excel sales reports into analyzable reports by channel, SKU, and date.</p>
</div>
<div class="detail-grid">
<div class="detail-block"><h4>Problem</h4><p>T-Soft and marketplace sales data are exported in different formats. T-Soft may require multiple CSV files, while marketplace reports arrive as Excel files with a separate column structure. Analyzing these files separately and seeing total SKU sales with channel performance in one report required manual work.</p></div>
<div class="detail-block"><h4>Solution</h4><p>The application accepts multiple T-Soft CSV files and one marketplace Excel file from the same screen, then converts them into a shared report structure. Marketplace sales are analyzed with sub-channel breakdowns, while T-Soft sales are handled through process filters and saveable templates. Total SKU summary, channel summary, date filtering, and Excel export are delivered in a single flow.</p></div>
<div class="detail-block wide"><h4>Impact</h4><p>E-commerce sales data from different sources were unified in one application, greatly reducing the need for manual file comparison, pivot preparation, and report merging. Total SKU performance and marketplace/T-Soft channel distribution became visible in just a few clicks.</p></div>
</div>
